3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:38,000
The Star Festival is an annual event in which the number of stars bestowed upon each of the Magic Knight Squads during that year by the Wizard King is announced to the public.

5
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:45,000
The squad whose accomplishments were greater than all the others is awarded the topmost rank, which is an unparalleled honor.

6
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:51,000
