162
00:09:18,660 --> 00:09:21,720
Your squad might have gotten first place and set a new record and everything,

163
00:09:21,860 --> 00:09:23,600
but you better not let that go to your head either,

164
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:26,940
because I'm going to make sure I earn double the number of stars you get next time!

165
