176
00:10:03,460 --> 00:10:05,480
They've produced outstanding results,

177
00:10:05,620 --> 00:10:08,120
considering the fact they've only been knights for half a year.

178
00:10:08,620 --> 00:10:12,520
Interestingly, these 16-year-olds are childhood friends from the same hometown.

179
00:10:12,900 --> 00:10:15,760
For being so young, those two are doing marvelous things.

180
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,520
