200
00:11:04,940 --> 00:11:31,300
Why do you always put the cool, crazy stuff like this on me out of nowhere?

201
00:11:31,300 --> 00:11:33,500
You're stronger now!

202
00:11:33,820 --> 00:11:37,320
What, are you trying to kill me during my 15 seconds of fame, you big jerk?

203
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:39,900
