216
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:21,780
This is no time to dwell on our differences!

217
00:12:21,980 --> 00:12:23,260
We can all fight together!

218
00:12:27,460 --> 00:12:28,280
You know.

219
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:29,260
Yeah.

220
00:12:30,400 --> 00:12:31,500
Look at us.

221
00:12:32,800 --> 00:12:34,800
We've really come this far.

222
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:45,420
Now that everyone's gotten back in a celebratory mood, I'll go ahead and announce the remainder of the Magic Knight Rankings.

223
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:49,220
Third place, the Silver Eagles with 95 stars.

224
00:12:50,060 --> 00:12:53,160
Fourth place, the Blue Rose Knights with 83 stars.

225
00:12:53,920 --> 00:12:57,660
Fifth place, the Crimson Lion Kings with 76 stars.

226
00:12:58,180 --> 00:13:02,180
Sixth place, the Green Preying Mantises with 69 stars.

227
00:13:02,180 --> 00:13:06,380
Seventh place, the Coral Peacocks with 67 stars.

228
00:13:06,980 --> 00:13:10,180
Eighth place, the Purple Orcas with 51 stars.

229
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:15,140
And lastly, in ninth place, the Aqua Deer with 49 stars.

230
00:13:15,260 --> 00:13:16,560
That's all we got?

231
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:20,640
And on that note, the Magic Knight Star Ceremony has come to an end.

232
00:13:21,040 --> 00:13:24,500
I trust our squads will continue doing good work in the coming year.

233
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:26,080
