249
00:13:58,560 --> 00:14:00,000
Next stop, first place!

250
00:14:00,340 --> 00:14:03,060
And when that happens, we'll dance for joy!

251
00:14:03,700 --> 00:14:05,200
We love you, Magic Lakes!

252
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:11,100
All right, now that we're finished with the star ceremony announcements, it is finally

253
00:14:11,100 --> 00:14:11,660
