264
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:51,360
Move over three feet!

265
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:52,460
Oh, sorry.

266
00:14:53,540 --> 00:14:57,040
That's better.

267
00:14:57,820 --> 00:15:01,100
Good evening and felicitations, my adoring followers.

268
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:06,480
I am your beloved and benevolent monarch, the celebrated king, Augustus Kira Clover the

269
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:07,120
13th.

270
00:15:07,560 --> 00:15:10,240
All hail the king, I guess.

271
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:15,540
You can do better than that!

272
00:15:15,780 --> 00:15:17,920
Yikes, is that all it took for him to snap?

273
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:18,800
Unbelievable.

274
00:15:19,420 --> 00:15:20,520
You excellent fools!

275
00:15:20,520 --> 00:15:25,040
I am the sovereign of this great kingdom, and I demand admiration by making myself clear!

276
00:15:25,300 --> 00:15:29,260
Witness this awe-inspiring royal magic power headed down through the generations!

277
00:15:29,660 --> 00:15:30,920
By every single thought!

278
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:31,960
And my appearance!

279
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:35,200
I am a most fitting and proper king in all respects!

280
00:15:35,340 --> 00:15:38,800
This makes me far superior to a mere wizard king!

281
00:15:38,800 --> 00:15:44,860
I wish the wizard king could just be our king.

282
00:15:44,860 --> 00:15:45,860
This guy's a mess!

283
00:15:45,860 --> 00:15:47,620
Why is he in charge?

284
00:15:47,620 --> 00:15:50,040
It's not like we need two separate kings.

285
00:15:50,040 --> 00:15:53,600
I think the wizard king should be our real king from now on!

286
00:15:53,600 --> 00:16:00,100
Your majesty, please calm down and pull yourself together.

287
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:02,180
A curse upon you, Julius!

288
00:16:02,660 --> 00:16:06,920
How easily you win the affection of the people when I suffer such difficulty!

289
00:16:07,880 --> 00:16:12,500
And what's more, the golden dawn is victorious again!

290
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:14,320
That feather-faced buffoon!

291
00:16:14,520 --> 00:16:16,040
It's an outrage, I tell you!

292
00:16:16,040 --> 00:16:19,280
Some of the other captains have royal blood!

293
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:23,380
They're much worthier of first place than that pompous peacock!

294
00:16:25,420 --> 00:16:29,760
I'll just have to make a dramatic announcement and win the support of my flock!

295
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:31,960
Citizens!

296
00:16:32,640 --> 00:16:35,540
I have an important piece of news to share with you!

297
00:16:37,180 --> 00:16:40,220
We have located the Midnight Sun's hideout!

298
00:16:40,340 --> 00:16:40,720
Huh?

299
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:43,080
We really found it?

300
00:16:43,680 --> 00:16:48,280
So far in our battle against them, we've consistently been one step behind.

301
00:16:48,600 --> 00:16:50,080
But those days are over!

302
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:55,160
You will be pleased to know that we're preparing to launch a full-scale counter-attack of our own!

303
00:16:55,360 --> 00:17:00,000
And to do so, we plan to gather the absolute cream of the crop from our magic knight squads!

304
00:17:00,580 --> 00:17:03,540
Allowing us to assemble the most elite team imaginable!

305
00:17:04,260 --> 00:17:07,380
And that unit will be called the Royal Knights!

306
00:17:07,380 --> 00:17:14,480
In a week's time, I shall administer a rigorous exam to the members of all nine magic knight squads!

307
00:17:14,740 --> 00:17:18,420
Only those who pass the test will be invited to join my Royal Knights!

308
00:17:19,100 --> 00:17:22,440
And then, we will obliterate the eye of the Midnight Sun!

309
00:17:23,100 --> 00:17:25,100
Now listen carefully, my magic knights!

310
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:28,680
I ask you to offer up your grimoires in service to your country!

311
00:17:29,680 --> 00:17:30,940
Royal Knights!

312
00:17:30,940 --> 00:17:32,260
They can do it!

313
00:17:32,300 --> 00:17:32,740
Brilliant!

314
00:17:34,860 --> 00:17:35,420
Success!

315
00:17:35,420 --> 00:17:39,700
Julius came up with the idea and took care of all the research!

316
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:41,740
But I'm still getting the credit!

317
00:17:42,460 --> 00:17:44,420
Why's the king picking people, though?

318
00:17:44,660 --> 00:17:44,880
Huh?

319
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:47,560
Shouldn't the wizard king handle all that stuff?

320
00:17:47,740 --> 00:17:51,780
I mean, he knows more about the magic knights than the king does, plus everybody likes him more!

321
00:17:52,720 --> 00:17:53,640
Think about it!

322
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:58,020
The wizard king does cool stuff all the time, and I never heard of King Clover doing anything that great!

323
00:17:58,520 --> 00:17:59,580
What about you?

324
00:18:00,060 --> 00:18:00,820
I don't know.

325
00:18:00,820 --> 00:18:05,780
So he's got this super awesome magic power, but he's never used it to make life better for the kingdom.

326
00:18:06,140 --> 00:18:06,600
Is that right?

327
00:18:07,340 --> 00:18:08,580
Yeah, I guess so.

328
00:18:08,780 --> 00:18:09,360
I don't know.

329
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:12,440
Maybe it's because I don't have any power, so tell me if I'm missing the point here.

330
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:17,220
But I gotta say, from where I'm standing, it kind of seems to me like the king is totally pointless and dull.

331
00:18:17,220 --> 00:18:18,940
Just, uh, quit talking and read the room.

332
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:22,720
No matter how right you are, it's better to keep those comments to yourself.

333
00:18:23,260 --> 00:18:23,660
Huh?

334
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:25,380
Sounds like you agree with me!

335
00:18:27,180 --> 00:18:28,120
I like this kid.

336
00:18:28,180 --> 00:18:29,160
He tells it like it is.

337
00:18:35,220 --> 00:18:36,620
Walk with their hands!

338
00:18:36,620 --> 00:18:40,460
I want both of those traitors to be executed at once, right here at the festival!

339
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:41,360
Huh?

340
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:43,200
Thanks for getting us killed.

341
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:45,460
Yeah, Yudo didn't say anything bad!

342
00:18:46,020 --> 00:18:46,780
Execute them?

343
00:18:47,560 --> 00:18:48,000
Seriously?

344
00:18:48,600 --> 00:18:49,220
Kill them!

345
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:50,100
Kill them!

346
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:51,100
Kill them!

347
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:52,800
I want them dead!

348
00:18:54,940 --> 00:18:57,960
I do apologize for their impertinence, Your Majesty.

349
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:03,120
However, for my sake, I must implore you to find it in your heart to pardon this transgression.

350
00:19:03,120 --> 00:19:08,740
After all, they may turn out to be the shield that protects you from an attack one of these days.

351
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:11,440
Besides, this is a trivial matter.

352
00:19:11,900 --> 00:19:13,460
Best not to throw your weight around.

353
00:19:13,680 --> 00:19:15,360
It'll cheapen your royal authority.

354
00:19:17,800 --> 00:19:19,380
Now, royal knights!

355
00:19:19,580 --> 00:19:21,060
I expect great things!

356
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:26,200
I'm certain our magic knights will meet this challenge with profound strength and courage.

357
00:19:26,620 --> 00:19:27,140
Obviously.

358
00:19:27,980 --> 00:19:31,500
If he chooses a green praying mantis, it'll raise the squad's reputation.

359
00:19:31,500 --> 00:19:34,140
Gami won't be ahead of me for much longer.

360
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:38,140
I gotta work hard and make sure we don't end up in last place again!

361
00:19:39,580 --> 00:19:40,100
Sheesh.

362
00:19:40,640 --> 00:19:44,000
This royal knight's idea's got Julius written all over it.

363
00:19:44,600 --> 00:19:47,100
He sure comes up with some interesting stuff.

364
00:19:49,580 --> 00:19:50,460
Wizard King!

365
00:19:50,660 --> 00:19:53,820
I'm really, really, really sorry for making the king mad!

366
00:19:53,940 --> 00:19:54,260
Really!

367
00:19:54,260 --> 00:19:56,660
Where's my apology?

368
00:19:57,520 --> 00:19:59,680
I almost got executed because of you.

369
00:19:59,760 --> 00:20:05,400
For knights like you who aspire to be the wizard king, the royal knights are a chance to do even greater deeds.

370
00:20:05,500 --> 00:20:05,720
Right!

371
00:20:06,720 --> 00:20:10,220
But, impressive though you are, you're still newcomers.

372
00:20:10,760 --> 00:20:13,840
You'll have some stiff competition when you take that exam.

373
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:16,920
The likes of which you've yet to encounter.

374
00:20:17,180 --> 00:20:18,240
Sounds fun to me!

375
00:20:18,240 --> 00:20:22,800
Even if I don't succeed, I'll at least be proud to have made it that far.

376
00:20:24,740 --> 00:20:27,160
You two keep working hard and stay modest.

377
00:20:27,600 --> 00:20:29,860
Well, until next time, sir!

378
00:20:29,860 --> 00:20:30,060
Sir!

379
00:20:33,940 --> 00:20:39,340
I got no idea what kind of exam they're gonna make us take to join the royal knights, but I'm ready to punch it right in the face!

380
00:20:39,420 --> 00:20:41,980
Try not to cry if I pass and you fail, okay?

381
00:20:41,980 --> 00:20:47,820
The only ones who will be crying are those Eye of the Midnight Sun losers when I ace this test and kick their butts in the next week!

382
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:52,560
That's another reason why I need to learn how to handle that crazy new power I just got.

383
00:20:56,360 --> 00:20:57,200
Damn you!

384
